<title>USA: CME live cattle certificates for Aug 29.</title>
<headline>CME live cattle certificates for Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the following certificates tendered for August 29 against the August Live Cattle contract.</p>
<p>Tenders 1, retenders 0, demands 0, reclaims 0. Total to date tenders and retenders 943 (tenders 691, retenders 252), demands 242, reclaims 0.</p>
<p>No contracts open.</p>
